 — what','Country: Norway\n\nasdasdasd','2026-08-26 06:19:21','2026-08-26 06:19:21',0,'new'),(16,'yatra','r@jak.com',NULL,'Booking: Phulchoki Day Hike — info','Country: nepal\n\nhello','2026-08-26 07:49:44','2026-08-26 07:49:44',0,'new');
